Changes in the FFmpeg code this package is built from, relative to FFmpeg n4.4 (LGPL 2.1 section 2(b) notice):
the fork https://github.com/wmarti/FFmpeg (commit 0604b464c7cb, 2026-02-11, from xenia-project/FFmpeg) adds the
XMA frame decoder used for Xbox 360 audio. Files compiled into this package that differ from n4.4 are listed below
with their differences. The ReXGlue SDK build adds generated list files (thirdparty/ffmpeg-overlay).

